<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Piliphisiyoose Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Piliphisiyoose Asaas Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Piliphisiyoose Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Piliphisiyoose Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ha kiitaza xaafiday Maqidooniya geetettiza Oroome kawoy haarizason diza Piliphisiyoose geetettiza deren diza Woosa Keeththayssa. Hinna he Woosa Keeththaya Phawuloosi koyro Awuroppan essida Woosa Keeththayo; Piliphisiyoose kataman diza asaappe dariza baggay Oroome biittafe yida asa; hessafe dendidayssan daroti otoretteettes. (Hawa 16:21) Isttafe baggayti Kirstoosan ammanizayta; hessa gishshas ba asatan ixettidaytanne goodettizayta gidida; hessika istti ha alame duussan manqo gidana mala ooththides. (2Qoro 8:2) Gidikkoka istti ammanon minni eqqidi hankko ammanishe waayettizayta maaddizayta gidida; hessa gaason Phawuloosi istta addafe siiqees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitay xaafettiday Phawuloosi qashoson dishin hankko ammaniza oosanchchatappe eqeteththi iza gakkiin Piliphisiyoosen diza Woosa Keeththey garsan dendida wordo timirte gaason iza wozinay meqqi dishinna. Gido attiin ha kiitazan qoncci beettizay ufayssinne kumeththa ammaneteth. Phawuloosi hessa he kiitaza xaafida gaasoykka izi metoti dishin Piliphoosinne ammaniza asay izas maado yeddida gishshas istta galatanaasko! Iza bolla gidiin woykko istta bolla dumma dumma metoti gakkikokka isttas daro xalateththinne kumeththa mino ammanoy isttas daana mala izi istta minththeththees. Otoreteththinne ceeqeteth aggidi Yesus Kirstoosa ashketeththan kumana mala izi istta minththi qofsees. Istti Yesus Kirstoosara Ayanan issino gididi demmida de7ozi Xoossa kiyateththafe beettidayssanne istti ammanon ekkidayssafe attiin woga naagon beettidayssa gidenna giidi izi istta qofsees. Yesus Kirstoosara issifeteththan diza ubbatas Xoossi isttas immiza saroteththa gishshassinne ufayssa gishshassika xaafides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hayssi ha kiitazi erettizay ufays, ammaneteth, issifeteththinne ammanon de7on minni eqqana mala qonccisi bessizayssanna; qasseka Hawaare Phawuloosi Piliphisiyoose Woosa Keeththayo daro siiqizayssa qonccisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa duussa gishshas <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanon duussas leemiso <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximtoosanne Afrodixo qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano ixxizaytappe naagettana mala yooto <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosi Piliphisiyoosen ammanizaytas shiishshida galatanne zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Yesus Kirstoosa oosanchcha gidida Phawuloosappenne Ximtoosappe Woosa Keeththa cimataranne daaqonetara issife Piliphisiyoose deren diza ammanizaytas Yesus Kirstoosas dummatidaytas ubbaas,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12">Hawa 16:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>nu Aawaa Xoossaafe, Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Inttena qoppiza ubba gallas tani ta Xoossaa galatays. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Ubba gallas intte gishshas ta woossiza wode ufayssan woossays. <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>Koyro gallassafe haa simmiin hanno gakkanaas Mishiraachcho qaalaa ooson intte tanara deeta. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Inttenan lo7o ooso doommidayssi izi Yesus Kirstoosi wurseththa pirdas yaana gakkanaas inttena dandayssanayssa ta ammanays.<verse eid="PHP 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Ta ha7i qasho keeththan dishininne ta qashettanaappeka kase Mishiraachcho qaalaa tuma naaganaassinne minththeththanaas Xoossi taas ba kiyateththan immida maadon intte wurikka tanara issife ooththidayta gidida gishshas intte ubba gallas ta wozinappe dhayekketa; hessa gishshas tani intte gishshas qoppanaas bessees. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Ta inttena Yesus Kirstoosa siiqon wostta laamotizaakko Xoossi taas markka.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Intte siiqoy erateththaninne akeekan keehi darana mala ta woossays. <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Hessika intte ubbaafe aadhdhizayssa shaakki erana malanne Yesus Kirstoosa yuussa gallas gakkanaas intte geeshshatanne wosoy bayndayta gidana mala koyays. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Xoossa bonchchisizayssanne galatissizayssa intte ooththana mala Yesus Kirstoosan beettiza geeshshateththa ayfen intte wozinay kumo.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qasheteththan Mishiraachcho Qaalaa Dich</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Ha7ikka ta ishatoo! Ta bolla gakkida metoy Mishiraachcho qaalay kaseppe keehi aakkanaas gididayssa intte erana mala ta koyays. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Hessa gishshas ta qasheteththay Kirstoosa gishshas gididayssi kawo keeththa zabetassinne harataska erettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Hawa 28:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Ta qashettidayssa gaason ammanizayti Xoossa qaalaa babbontta xalateththan asas markkattanaas minoteth demmida.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Issi issi asati coo nu izappe waanidon geeththaninne hoolloteththan sabbakeettes; baggayti qasse lo7o qofara Kirstoosa gishshas sabbakeettes. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Baggayti tani Mishiraachcho qaalaa gishshas mootettana haan dizayssa eriza gishshas siiqon sabbakeettes. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Hankkoyti qasse lo7o qofan gidontta tana gakkida qashoza bolla hara waaye gaththanaassinne ba iita qofaa polanaas Kirstoosa sabbakeettes.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Hessa gidikko ay metoo dizay! Waanna ayfe yo7oy suureteththan gidiin woykko misatisson gidiinkka awarakka Kirstoosa sabbakiza gishshas ta ufayettays. <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Ta bolla gakkida metoppe ta aadhdhanay intte woosaninne Yesus Kirstoosa Ayana maadon gididayssa ta erays. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Ta ay ogerakka yeellatontta mala mino ufayssinne laamotay taas dees; gido attiin kasekka hachchika, ta hayqqiinka paxa diinka Kirstoosi ta ashon bonchchettanayssa tani xalateththan haasayays. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Taas duus guussi Kirstoosa; hayqoykka taas go7a. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Gido attiin tani hayssa asho duussan gujja dizaakko ayfe immiza ooso ooththays guussa; ta awayssa dooranaakko taas erettenna. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Ha nam7u hanotan metotettadis; ta baada Kirstoosara daanaas laamotays; hessi hara ubbaafe keehi lo7o. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Gido attiin taas ashon duussi inttes keehi koshshees.<verse eid="PHP 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Hessa akeekada intte ammanon diccana malanne ufayettana mala intte ubbata matan gam7anayssanne daanayssa ta erays. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Ta hee baada intte achchan de7ikko ta gaason inttes Kirstoosan diza ceeqeteththi darana.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Kirstoosa Mishiraachcho qaalaas bessiza mala diite; hessaththo haankka ta inttena baada be7idaakko woykko haahon daada intte gishshas ta siyizaakko intte Mishiraachcho qaalaa ammanos issife olettishe issi Ayanan intte minni eqqanayssa ta erays. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Ay ogerakka inttenara eqettizaytas hirgofte; hessi istti dhayanayssassinne intte attanayssas Xoossafe imettida malata. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Intte Kirstoosa ammanizayta xalla gidontta iza gishshas waaye ekkizayta gidana mala hayssi Xoossa kiyateththi inttes imettides. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Intte kase be7ida mala ha7ikka ta bolla dizayssa intte siyizayssa mala hessaththo inttenakka waayison dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Hawa 16:19-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ashketeth Kirstoosappe Tamaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1-2"/>Inttes Kirstoosa baggara beettida issifeteththaa gaason issoy issaa minththeththizaaz siiqo gidiinkka woykko Ayana issifeteth woykko maaroynne asas misheteththi intte garsan diikko intte as siiqon issi Ayananinne issi qofan gididi ta ufays polite. <verse eid="PHP 2:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>As ubbaa inttefe bollara xeellite attiin intterkka inttena doson woykko go7ay baynda galata ekkanaas issi miishshika ooththofte. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Inttefe issi issi asi hara as go7izayssa xeellite attiin intte go7a xalla xeellofte.<verse eid="PHP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Yesus Kirstoosas diza ashketeththi intte achchanka do. <verse eid="PHP 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Izi Xoossakoshin bana Xoossara ginisanaas koyibeenna.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Gido attiin aylle medha ekkidi as misatidi barkka bana eeya as kessides. <verse eid="PHP 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>As gidi qonccidikka bana asappe ziqqisides; hayqqana gakkanaas hessika masqale bolla kaqetti hayqqana gakkanaas azazettides. <verse eid="PHP 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi iza daro dhoqqu histtides; sunth ubbaafe dhoqqu gida sunth izas immides.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Hessika saloninne sa7an, sa7appe garsankka diza medheteththinne gulbatey wuri Yesusa sunththaas gulbatana malassa. <verse eid="PHP 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Asa inxarsi wurikka Xoossaa Aawaa bonchchos Yesus Kirstoosi Godaa gididayssa markkattanaassa.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dere Poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Intte kase ubba wode azazettizayta gidida mala ha7ikka tani matan dontta inttefe haahon diikkoka intte atoteththay kumeth gidana mala yashshateththaninne bonchchon polite. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Xoossi inttes azazeteth immishe ba qofaa wurseth gakkanaas intte giddon ooththees.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Ay miishshika zuuzunththinne palamay baynda ooththite. <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>Hessika intte iitanne geella asa giddon geeshshatanne wosoy baynda Xoossa nayta gididi alame bolla arshe mala dere ubbaas poo7anaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Zaare 32:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Intte ekkida de7o qaalaa lo7eththi oykkiko Kirstoosi haa simmi yiza wode ta mela daaburonttayssa gishshas ta ceeqettanaazi taas dees.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Qasseka inttes Godaan diza ammanoy intte Xoossas shiishshida dumma yarsho mala ta shemppoy intte yarshora issife yarsho mala gukkizaakko inttenara tanikka ufayettana. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Hessaththoka intte inttes ufayettidi tanakka ufayssanaas bessees.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximtoosa Woosanne Afrodixo Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Goday maaddiko Ximtoosa intteko yeddada intte lo7eteththaa gishshas lo7o woreta siyanaas koyays. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Intte lo7eteththaa gishshas qoppiza asi hara iza malay oonikka baa. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Haray wurikka Yesus Kirstoosayssa gidontta ba go7as woxxizaade xalala. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Gido attiin intte erizayssa mala Ximtoosi izi ay mala asakko ba gishshas markkasides. Nay ba aawara ooththiza mala tanara Mishiraachcho qaalaa yootides. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Hessa gishshas hayssafe sinththan ta waananaakko shaakka eridaappe guye iza ta intteko kiittana qoppays. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Tanikka intteko mata wode baanayssa Godaan ammanettays.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Hessaththoka intte tana koshshiza miishshan ubbaan maaddana malanne lo7eththi oykkana mala yeddida Afrodixo ta intteko zaara yeddana mala koshshizayssi taas erettides. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Gaasoykka izi inttena kumeththata beyanaas laamotida gishshassinne qasseka intte iza sakoza siyidayssas qoppida gishshassa. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Tumappeka izi hargidi hayqqishe attides; gido attiin Xoossi iza maarides; ta kase muuzottizayssa bolla hara muuzoy gujettontta mala tanakka maaddides.<verse eid="PHP 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Hessa gishshas intte iza be7idi ufayettana malanne tanikka hirgafe shempana mala amottays. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Intte iza keehi ufayssan mokki ekkite; iza mala asatakka bonchchite. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Intte tana matan diidi ooththi maaddanaas dandayontta gishshas izi ba shemppos mishettontta tana ooththi maaddidi Kirstoosa ooso gaason hayqqishe attides.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ashon Ceeqettanaas Bessenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Ta ishatoo! Hayssafe hara ta inttena gizay Godaan ufayettite; ha7ikka zaarada izo ta inttes xaafikko tana saleththenna; inttenakka go7ana.<verse eid="PHP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Heyta kana mala huskkattizaytappe, iita ooththizaytappenne asas meqeth menththiza asatappe naagettite. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Tumu qaxxarettidayti, Xoos woossizayti, Yesus Kirstoosan ceeqqizayti, ashon ceeqettonttaytinne ashonkka ammanettonttayti nuna.<verse eid="PHP 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Tani ceeqqana koykko asho baggara ceeqqana miishshi taaska dees; oonaska ashon ceeqqiza miishshi dizaa misatikko ta izappe aadhdhays. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Tani yelettida osppunththa gallas qaxxarettadis; ta Isra7eele zereththinne Biniyaame kochchafe yelettadis; Ibraaweta giddon tanikka adda Ibraawe; woga baggara oychchizaadey diikko ta kase Farsaawe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Oro 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:6">Hawa 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Muse wogaas zil7ettizayssa gidikko tani kase Woosa Keeththaa gooddizaade. Wogaa naagon beettiza xilloteth gidikko kase ta bolla issi wosoykka deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="PHP 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Gido attiin taas go7a gididayssa ubbaa Kirstoosa gishshas gaada go7ay baynda miishsha mala qoodadis. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Hessafekka ta Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa eroppe aadhdhizay haray aykkoyka bayndayssa ta ammaniza gishshas ubbaaka go7ay baynda miishsha mala qoodadis; tani iza gishshas gaada ubbaaka aggadis; ta Kirstoosa demmana gaada ubba miishshaakka wora wodhdhida iita miishsha mala qoodadis. <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>Tani hessaththo ooththiza gaasoykka kase Muse wogaan taas diza xilloteththaa aggada ammanon beettiza Xoossa xilloteth Kirstoosan ammanada demmanaassinne ta izara issife de7anaassa. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Kirstoosanne izi hayqqi dendida denththaa wolqqa ta erana mala iza waayekka ta izara gishettana malanne hayqonkka ta iza misatana mala amottays. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Hessaththoka ta hayqqa dendidaappe guye mernaas daanaas koyays.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseth Gakkanaas Woththe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Ta hayssa wursa demmadis woykko hayssaththo hanadis guus gidenna; gido attiin Yesus Kirstoosi tana baas histtidi taas giigsida woyto ekkanaas minna woththa bolla days. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ta ishatoo! Ta ha7i ta koyzayssaka oykkida mala qoodikke; gido attiin ta issi miish ooththana; taappe guyera dizayssa agga aggada taappe sinththan dizayssa oykkanaas zaradhdhays. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Xoossi tana Yesus Kirstoosa baggara pude xeygida gishshas woyto gakka ekkanaas elelays.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Hessa gishshas nuni ammanon minnidayti wurikka haniza yo7o ubbaa hessaththo xeellanaas bessees; issi issi dumma qofay inttes diikko hessaka Xoossi inttes qonccisana. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Gidikkoka nu ha7i gakki eridaazan ane simerettoos.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Ta ishatoo! Ane intte ta haniza mala tana kaallitenne haratarakka issife de7ite; nuni nuna inttes leemiso histti bessida mala diza asata wozinan woththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Qoro 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Gaasoykka hayssafe kase ta inttes zaara zaara yootida mala ha7ikka zaarada afunththara inttes yootays; daroti Kirstoosa masqales morkke gididi simeretteettes. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Istta wurseththi dhayo; istta uloy istta Xoossa; isttas kawushshateththay isttas bonchcho; istta wozinay shempiday ha biittaa duussanna. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Nu derey gidikko salonna; heeppe buro yaanayssa nuna ashshida Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa yuussaa laamoteththan naagon doos. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Izikka ubbaa baappe garsan haarisana dandayza ba wolqqan daaburanchcha gidida nu asateth bonchchettida ba asateth misatissidi laammana.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Ta inttena dosizaytoo! Ta inttena laamotizaytoo! Taas ufayssinne ooso zawude gidida ta ishatoo! Godaan minni eqqite.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Intte qofay Godaan issino gidana mala Ewodiyanne Sinxekey ba garsan siiqettana mala ta istta woossays. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Ero! Nenoo! Tanara issife ammanettida oosanchchazoo! Mishiraachcho qaalaa yootos tanaranne Qalamenxoosara qasseka istta sunththay de7o maxaafan xaafettida hankko tanara ooso laggetara issife waayettida maccassata ne maaddana mala ta nena woossays.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Ay wodekka Godaan ufayettite; qasseka ta inttena ufayettite gays. <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Intte kiyateththi as ubbaa achchan eretto; Goday yaana matides. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Haniza yo7on ubbaan galatan, woosaninne gaannateththan Xoossa sinth shiiqite attiin ay miishshankka hirgofte.<verse eid="PHP 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Asa qofappe bollara diza Xoossa saroteththi intte wozinanne intte qofaa wursi Yesus Kirstoosan naagees.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Wurseththa bolla ta ishatoo! Tumu gidida yo7o ubbaa, bonchcho gidida yo7o ubbaa, adda gidida yo7o ubbaa, geeshshi gidida yo7o ubbaa, dosettida miish ubbaa, lo7o gidida yo7o ubbaa, lo7eteth gidiinkka galatakka haytantta misatizaaz ubbaa qopite. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Intte taappe tamaardayssa woykko ekkidayssanne siyidayssa woykko be7idayssa ay gidikkoka ubbaa ooththite; Goday inttenara gidana.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Maaddidaytas Shiishshida Galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Daro wodeppe guye ooraththa qofara intte ta gishshas qofo oykkideta; hessika Godaa baggara tana keehi ufayssees; tumukka intte taas qofo aggibeekketashin intte qoppida mala ooththanaas inttes hano ixxides. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Tani hessa gizay tana metida gishshas gidenna; gaasoykka ta ay hankkoka, «Dizayssi taas gidana» guus tamaaradis. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Pacekka ta erays; demmadakka erays; gafadakka, kalladakka erays; diinka dhayiinkka erays; ay gidikkoka taas dizay gidana guussa xuura ta lo7eththa erays. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Taas wolqqa immiza Kirstoosan tani ubba miish ooththanaas dandayays.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Gidikkoka intte tana ta waayen maaddida gishshas lo7o ooththideta. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Intte Piliphisiyoose asati hessafe bollara intte erizay koyro Mishiraachcho qaalaa intte ekkida wode tani Maqidooniyappe dendashe inttefe attiin gede immidikka haa ekkidikka maadettidinne maaddidi giza Woosa Keeththi taas deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Qoro 11:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Haray attoshin ta kase Tasolonqen diza wodekka tani metotiin intte zaari zaari taas maado yeddideta. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Ta hessa gizay immida gishshas inttes anjjoy darana mala gaada attiin ta inttefe maado ekkanaas amottada gidenna.<verse eid="PHP 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Taas koshshizayssanne tana koshshizayssafekka bollara ekkadis; intte taas yeddida maado miishshaa Afrodixo kusheppe ekkiin ta pacey kumides; hayssi daroppe Xoossa achchan ekettida daro lo7o sawiza yarsho mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kessa 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Xoossi ba dureteththaa gina inttes koshshizayssa Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara kunththana. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Nu Aawassinne nu Xoossaas mernaappe mernaas bonchchoy gido. Amiin.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Ammaniza asa ubbaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththan saro giite; tanara diza ishati wurikka inttena saro geettes. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Ammanizayti wuri harappeka Qeesaareso asaappe ammanizayti wurikka inttena saro geettes.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa aadho kiyateththi inttenara gido. Amiin.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
